"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Suggested ecosystem verification commands and a final Offing re-scan.","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":3,"offset":749},"end":{"line":17,"column":72,"offset":818}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":3,"offset":749},"end":{"line":17,"column":72,"offset":818}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1,"offset":747},"end":{"line":17,"column":72,"offset":818}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1,"offset":314},"end":{"line":17,"column":72,"offset":818}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Built-in registry rules carry reviewed migration guidance next to their lifecycle evidence. This keeps the scan engine and CLI independent of ecosystem-specific migration knowledge. External detectors can provide the same optional guidance through the detector SDK; otherwise Offing emits a conservative generic packet.","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1,"offset":820},"end":{"line":19,"column":320,"offset":1139}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1,"offset":820},"end":{"line":19,"column":320,"offset":1139}}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Safety and determinism","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":4,"offset":1144},"end":{"line":21,"column":26,"offset":1166}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1,"offset":1141},"end":{"line":21,"column":26,"offset":1166}},"data":{"id":"safety-and-determinism","hProperties":{"id":"safety-and-determinism"}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Offing generates context but never edits files or executes verification commands. Packet generation is local, deterministic for a scan result, and does not require an LLM or network access.","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1,"offset":1168},"end":{"line":23,"column":190,"offset":1357}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1,"offset":1168},"end":{"line":23,"column":190,"offset":1357}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value"